{"title": "Tippler's Rage", "pageid": 28054, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Tippler's_Rage", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Tippler's Rage</b> is a passive feature that enhances your chance to hit and causes a blast with extra damage, but only while drunk.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While you are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Drunk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Condition)\">Drunk</a>, you have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>. You also create a blast with each melee hit landed, dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a> damage to all creatures and objects in a radius of 3 m (10 ft), excluding yourself. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Tippler.27s_Rage\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Tippler's_Rage\"> Condition: Tippler's Rage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tippler%27s_Rage_(Condition)\" title=\"Tippler's Rage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Generic_Thunder_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Thunder_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Generic_Thunder_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Thunder_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Generic_Thunder_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Thunder_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tippler's Rage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Generic_Thunder_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Thunder_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Generic_Thunder_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tippler%27s_Rage_(Condition)\" title=\"Tippler's Rage (Condition)\">Tippler's Rage</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>While the affected entity is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(Condition)\" title=\"Alcohol (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Drunk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(Condition)\" title=\"Alcohol (Condition)\">Drunk</a>, it has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>. It also creates a blast with each melee hit landed, dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a> damage to all creatures and objects in a radius of 3 m (10 ft), excluding the wielder.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Punch-Drunk_Bastard\" title=\"Punch-Drunk Bastard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Punch-Drunk_Bastard\" title=\"Punch-Drunk Bastard\">Punch-Drunk Bastard</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>When the in-game description of Tippler's Rage mentions being drunk, it is referring to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Drunk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Condition)\">Drunk</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Drunken_Master)_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Drunken Master) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Drunk (Drunken Master)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Drunken_Master)_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Drunken Master) (Condition)\">Drunk (Drunken Master)</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(Condition)\" title=\"Alcohol (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alcohol\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(Condition)\" title=\"Alcohol (Condition)\">Alcohol</a> conditions.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>While 'drunk', <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> from Tippler's Rage applies to <i>any</i> attack roll made by the wielder – including <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">throw</a>, and spell attack rolls.</li>\n<li>Although not specified with the in-game description, the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a> damage from Tippler's Rage only triggers on melee weapon attacks.</li>\n<li>Attacks which deal multiple instances of damage (e.g., the various <a href=\"/wiki/Smite\" title=\"Smite\">Smite</a> spells or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Booming_Blade\" title=\"Booming Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/30px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Booming Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Booming_Blade\" title=\"Booming Blade\">Booming Blade</a>) will also trigger multiple instances of Tippler's Rage.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201900\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.080 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.088 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3554/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36455/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13975/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.030/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 966392/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   74.478      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   74.478      1 -total\n 34.14%   25.429      4 Template:SmCond\n 25.30%   18.840     11 Template:Icon_text\n 24.23%